  "gaps": [
    "geneOS holds no per-host ethanol capability: no host page states whether a given host (for example CEN.PK113-7D or the E. coli BL21 host) makes ethanol, so the host-level answer rests only on which hosts have a model linked.",
    "No ethanol ceiling has been computed for the CEN.PK113-7D host, since no genome-scale model is on its page; a model for that strain would need to be added to the shelf.",
    "No ethanol ceiling exists for the E. coli core or iJO1366 models on geneOS; their shelf entries name phb as the product route, not ethanol.",
    "The ceilings are flux-balance upper bounds on the model, not measured ethanol yields from any strain; no run or record in the corpus confirms them."
  ],
